{"access":"public","aliases":[],"assertions":[],"claim_ids":[],"created_at":"2026-09-14T04:04:38Z","created_by_operation":"op_91c2fa8210644eb483ae74b9aa55eda8","id":"pg_00148cd78f1b57408dcfc94ef88f9b94","maturity":"draft","page_type":"source","path":"pages/sources/landing-ai-ade-cli-docs-telemetry-md-d1995ffef4e6-c94ef88f9b94.md","record_type":"page","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","source_ids":["src_d455ee13edb85bacb1059dd60579c987"],"title":"landing-ai/ade-cli/docs/telemetry.md @ d1995ffef4e6","updated_at":"2026-09-14T04:04:38Z","updated_by_operation":"op_91c2fa8210644eb483ae74b9aa55eda8"}
{"access":"public","aliases":[],"assertions":[{"claim_ids":["clm_172b2232aaf1c05b69117947200624e8f308a25de161a126c272a41243cd21ba"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"`ade help --json` returns the entire shipped surface in one call — commands, flags, result shapes, topics, exit states, and store layout — aimed at agent bootstrap, and SKILL.md ships the agent contract."},{"claim_ids":["clm_1c9504e4df7ee748d62834926d41faae01b558e39c78f64d63e49622654727b5"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Every command accepts `--json` to emit one stable JSON object on stdout, and `ade help COMMAND` documents flags and result shapes."},{"claim_ids":["clm_295c7162c41987eadce87d9d37e4c8cf98785fbca8d21de07b638159c45ea1cb"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"The CLI offers `ade parse` to convert documents into grounded Markdown and elements, and `ade extract` to pull schema-shaped fields with page-and-box evidence, saving results to a local store at ~/.ade."},{"claim_ids":["clm_59b84b039b3425646bd9bfbf69137d9695c3af666107526577976707728c760e"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"The command surface includes parse, extract, find, crop, view, history list/clear, login/auth subcommands, version, update, and help, per the README command table."},{"claim_ids":["clm_91e29bae244e085a3d68414ab86dae6d4fa56bd3b5be90702c7034eb78410391"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"For non-PATH environments like CI or agent harnesses, the CLI can be invoked by absolute path (~/.ade/bin/ade, or %USERPROFILE%\\.ade\\bin\\ade.exe on Windows) with credentials via the ADE_API_KEY environment variable."},{"claim_ids":["clm_9288622aac4c5615bd57cd8e6ff04ac6997c128dfc77749c6847b3a9b797c4d6"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"The repository was formerly `agentic-doc`, the original ADE SDK, preserved unchanged on the legacy branch; since 2026-07-31 it ships the ADE CLI, licensed Apache-2.0."},{"claim_ids":["clm_b21d3bb051b65f565213c7f2b0811d867dc5103f5d61e89c852a0c5c58a054d5"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"The store lives at ~/.ade (app at ~/.ade/bin/ade), with ADE_HOME relocating it, ADE_CLI_VERSION pinning a version, and ADE_CLI_INSTALL_DIR changing the destination."},{"claim_ids":["clm_c09ed1d13078a561bee077f2af2df710337580509fcfd4907a82249dadd6081e"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Releases ship self-contained binaries for macOS, Linux, and Windows on arm64 and x86_64, requiring no Python or uv."},{"claim_ids":["clm_c2e31087356a2932e37d1ebc9c7b8083d0a4b44e83d4364ee7e4c812a6b5d7a5"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Re-running an identical command consumes no credits because results persist in the local store; parse dedup serves stored results with an explicit notice and only `--force` re-bills."},{"claim_ids":["clm_fcf9822ea88a5abd24909640e137840d381bf64b809dacb21239fbe0c7f39009"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"The CLI mentions new releases on stderr at most once a day, and ADE_NO_UPDATE_CHECK=1 disables that check; `ade update` self-updates, or points at uv tool upgrade for uv/pipx installs."}],"claim_ids":["clm_172b2232aaf1c05b69117947200624e8f308a25de161a126c272a41243cd21ba","clm_1c9504e4df7ee748d62834926d41faae01b558e39c78f64d63e49622654727b5","clm_295c7162c41987eadce87d9d37e4c8cf98785fbca8d21de07b638159c45ea1cb","clm_59b84b039b3425646bd9bfbf69137d9695c3af666107526577976707728c760e","clm_91e29bae244e085a3d68414ab86dae6d4fa56bd3b5be90702c7034eb78410391","clm_9288622aac4c5615bd57cd8e6ff04ac6997c128dfc77749c6847b3a9b797c4d6","clm_b21d3bb051b65f565213c7f2b0811d867dc5103f5d61e89c852a0c5c58a054d5","clm_c09ed1d13078a561bee077f2af2df710337580509fcfd4907a82249dadd6081e","clm_c2e31087356a2932e37d1ebc9c7b8083d0a4b44e83d4364ee7e4c812a6b5d7a5","clm_fcf9822ea88a5abd24909640e137840d381bf64b809dacb21239fbe0c7f39009"],"created_at":"2026-09-14T04:04:38Z","created_by_operation":"op_91c2fa8210644eb483ae74b9aa55eda8","id":"pg_1b8feb715d4c5c9188e3ef6ef79b658b","maturity":"draft","page_type":"source","path":"pages/sources/landing-ai-ade-cli-readme-md-d1995ffef4e6-ef6ef79b658b.md","record_type":"page","review_st