{"access":"public","aliases":[],"assertions":[],"claim_ids":[],"created_at":"2026-09-14T04:04:38Z","created_by_operation":"op_91c2fa8210644eb483ae74b9aa55eda8","id":"pg_8d98da3bc8245df3a7075769a5157e50","maturity":"draft","page_type":"source","path":"pages/sources/landing-ai-ade-cli-skill-md-d1995ffef4e6-5769a5157e50.md","record_type":"page","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","source_ids":["src_aaf868128db15a9485ca715239bba042"],"title":"landing-ai/ade-cli/SKILL.md @ d1995ffef4e6","updated_at":"2026-09-14T04:04:38Z","updated_by_operation":"op_91c2fa8210644eb483ae74b9aa55eda8"}
{"access":"public","aliases":[],"assertions":[{"claim_ids":["clm_16714afb5d316992c28803dd85912914f8cf29f5bcecc07877471a1ddb0228de"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"The proposal defines parse as an idempotent state machine (absent/pending/complete/failed/expired) over the store, blocking by default with --wait, where Ctrl-C stops waiting but never the server-side work."},{"claim_ids":["clm_6470e77b6e5cdfa042ff27b3fab27f6b7dad712241e284be818ee5dc57395807"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"A draft v2 proposal (revised 2026-07-21) re-keys the store on job item ids — a hash of verb, source path, content, and params — replacing content-derived doc ids, with a flat ~/.ade/jobs/<id>/ layout."},{"claim_ids":["clm_742dbdd84130d4a4f72e33af5ab890b91e8f6779fa12e8982cc47695739e74c7"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"The proposal targets the ADE v2 API: async POST /v2/parse and /v2/extract job contracts, priority/standard service tiers, parse returning markdown plus a structure tree with inline grounding {page, range, box}."},{"claim_ids":["clm_c2e31087356a2932e37d1ebc9c7b8083d0a4b44e83d4364ee7e4c812a6b5d7a5"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Re-running an identical command consumes no credits because results persist in the local store; parse dedup serves stored results with an explicit notice and only `--force` re-bills."},{"claim_ids":["clm_e2adc14c99702f12f6f24596de61e3736c145656179f72308feb2603f287cf56"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"The proposal notes the ADE v2 backend has no job cancel — submitted work always completes and bills — and encrypted PDFs are always rejected with a 422 (encrypted_pdf_unsupported)."},{"claim_ids":["clm_f475384775a5a00165b86df217bd062deedd4a007e6fbbfc1b27739f182932b1"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Per the proposal, extract accepts a parse job item id, a document path (reusing the latest completed parse or auto-parsing first), or bring-your-own markdown, and field-to-box evidence is computed as a local join stored as evidence.json."}],"claim_ids":["clm_16714afb5d316992c28803dd85912914f8cf29f5bcecc07877471a1ddb0228de","clm_6470e77b6e5cdfa042ff27b3fab27f6b7dad712241e284be818ee5dc57395807","clm_742dbdd84130d4a4f72e33af5ab890b91e8f6779fa12e8982cc47695739e74c7","clm_c2e31087356a2932e37d1ebc9c7b8083d0a4b44e83d4364ee7e4c812a6b5d7a5","clm_e2adc14c99702f12f6f24596de61e3736c145656179f72308feb2603f287cf56","clm_f475384775a5a00165b86df217bd062deedd4a007e6fbbfc1b27739f182932b1"],"created_at":"2026-09-14T04:04:38Z","created_by_operation":"op_91c2fa8210644eb483ae74b9aa55eda8","id":"pg_cd581a66bc5453da85fd0567ec37a630","maturity":"draft","page_type":"source","path":"pages/sources/landing-ai-ade-cli-docs-ade-cli-v2-proposal-md-d1995ffef4e6-0567ec37a630.md","record_type":"page","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","source_ids":["src_4713a86dd43c576bbc52a9107b3917a4"],"title":"landing-ai/ade-cli/docs/ade-cli-v2-proposal.md @ d1995ffef4e6","updated_at":"2026-09-14T04:04:38Z","updated_by_operation":"op_91c2fa8210644eb483ae74b9aa55eda8"}
